      "Explanation": "The lineage vehicle is the publicly transmitted way or authority of the ancestral lineage. In encounter records, unnamed monks ask masters for its highest principle or how its higher reach is proclaimed; Huangbo Xiyun asks Baizhang Huaihai how it has been shown to people from the past onward. Chengtian Zong later comments that the lineage vehicle is not easy to support. The phrase therefore names what is inherited, displayed, questioned, and sustained in the lineage rather than a literal conveyance."
